#Lights (vl)
// Formatting:
// point:       <vec3: position>                    <vec3: colour> <int: intensity> <int: shadow casting>
// directional:                   <vec3: direction> <vec3: colour> <int: intensity> <int: shadow casting>
// spot:        <vec3: position>  <vec3: direction> <vec3: colour> <int: intensity> <float: inner angle> <float: outer angle> <int: shadow casting>
// (I assume every directional light is the sun, and so defining multiple directional lights is undefined (and probably breaks things))
directional: 0.34815531 -0.8703882 -0.34815531                         0.992 0.753 0.608 5 1
spot:   0.0 4.0 -15.0       0.0 0.0 -1.0       1.0 1.0 1.0   50   35.0 40.0 1
// Brazier lights
// Main room
point: -2.0 -0.9 -10.2      0.8353 0.1804 0.0117     1 0
